@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
actor "Operátor" as Ops
participant "deploy-compose.sh" as Script
participant "Docker Compose" as Compose
database "PostgreSQL" as DB
participant "Migration service" as Mig
participant "hr-backend" as Api
participant "AI server\n(job-processor, cv-processor)" as AINode

Ops -> Script: Spuštění nasazení
Script -> Compose: build hr-backend, migration
Script -> Compose: up -d db
Compose -> DB: healthcheck ready
Script -> Compose: up migration --exit-code-from migration
Compose -> Mig: execute db:migrate
Mig -> DB: schéma upgrade
Script -> Compose: up -d hr-backend rabbitmq
Compose -> Api: start application
Api -> AINode: kontrola dostupnosti AI endpointů
Script -> Compose: ps a základní verifikace
@enduml
